./ I 00050300 $ 00050310 010                                                    
*  ESA/390 OPERATION REQUEST BLOCK AND INTERRUPTION RESPONSE   XA0003DK         
*  BLOCK, ONE PER OUTSTANDING OPERATION. DMKIOS IS REENTRANT   XA0003DK         
*  AND NEVER DISABLES -- IT HAS NO STNSM, STOSM OR SSM         XA0003DK         
*  ANYWHERE -- SO THESE CANNOT BE A SHARED WORK AREA. MAPPED   XA0003DK         
*  WITH ORBLOK AND IRBLOK IN XABLOKS. THE IRB IS SIXTY-FOUR    XA0003DK         
*  BYTES BECAUSE TSCH ALWAYS STORES ALL SIXTY-FOUR, EVEN       XA0003DK         
*  THOUGH M1 READS ONLY THE SCSW.                              XA0003DK         
*  DS 0D: SSCH AND TSCH BOTH TAKE A SPECIFICATION              XA0003DK         
*  EXCEPTION ON A MISALIGNED OPERAND.                          XA0003DK         
         DS    0D             DOUBLEWORD ALIGNED               XA0003DK         
IOBORB   DS    0XL32          ORB -- SEE ORBLOK IN XABLOKS     XA0003DK         
IOBOPARM DS    1F             INTERRUPTION PARAMETER           XA0003DK         
IOBOFL4  DS    1X             KEY AND SUSPEND CONTROL          XA0003DK         
IOBOFL5  DS    1X             FORMAT, PREFETCH, INIT STATUS    XA0003DK         
IOBOLPM  DS    1X             LOGICAL PATH MASK                XA0003DK         
IOBOFL7  DS    1X             LENGTH AND EXTENSION CONTROL     XA0003DK         
IOBOCCW  DS    1F             CCW ADDRESS FOR THIS OPERATION   XA0003DK         
         DS    5F             PAD -- SEE ORBLOK                XA0003DK         
IOBIRB   DS    0XL64          IRB -- SEE IRBLOK IN XABLOKS     XA0003DK         
IOBISCSW DS    0XL12          SUBCHANNEL STATUS WORD           XA0003DK         
IOBIFL0  DS    1X             KEY, SUSPEND, DEFERRED CC        XA0003DK         
IOBIFL1  DS    1X             FORMAT, INIT STATUS, ZERO CC     XA0003DK         
IOBIFL2  DS    1X             FUNCTION AND ACTIVITY CONTROL    XA0003DK         
IOBIFL3  DS    1X             ACTIVITY AND STATUS CONTROL      XA0003DK         
IOBICCW  DS    1F             CCW ADDRESS                      XA0003DK         
IOBIDST  DS    1X             DEVICE STATUS     -- TO CSW+4    XA0003DK         
IOBISST  DS    1X             SUBCHANNEL STATUS -- TO CSW+5    XA0003DK         
IOBICNT  DS    1H             RESIDUAL COUNT    -- TO CSW+6    XA0003DK         
         DS    XL20           EXTENDED STATUS WORD             XA0003DK         
         DS    XL32           EXTENDED CONTROL WORD            XA0003DK         
IOBXSAV  DS    4F             R14, R15, R0, R1 IN THE SHIMS    XA0003DK         
*  PER-IOBLOK, SO THE SHIMS STAY REENTRANT -- XAIO'S STATIC    XA0003DK         
*  WORK AREA IS NOT, WHICH IS WHY DMKIOS CANNOT USE XAIO.      XA0003DK         
